1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
You're not meant to see this whole garden at once.
这座园林，不让你一眼看全

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,300
Follow me into a Suzhou classical garden.
跟我走进苏州古典园林

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,600
A whole landscape — hills and water — in one courtyard.
一方庭院，装下整片山水

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,000
Winding paths hide the next view — new scenery every step.
曲径通幽，步移景异

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,300
Distant pagodas are "borrowed" into the frame.
远处宝塔，被"借"进画里

7
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,500
Double-tap if you'd get happily lost in here.
想在这儿迷路的点个赞

8
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,000
9 Suzhou gardens are UNESCO World Heritage.
苏州9座园林是世界遗产

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,200
Scholars built them as private escapes from the world.
文人造园，避世自处

10
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,000
★ Expert Tip: go to the Humble Administrator's Garden at opening — biggest, and empty the first hour.
拙政园开门就去，最大且头一小时没人

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Could you find your way out? Comments below.
你找得到出口吗？评论区见
